  <text>
    <body>
      <p>Many people were travelling towards the sky on snowshoes. They had nearly reached the sky. It is said that the people were on their way to the country of the dead in the sky.<note>See JE 2 : 597 (Shuswap).</note> Some one transformed the people and their trail into stars, and this is now the Milky Way.</p>
